CryptoNote fixtures
----------------------------
tests/fixtures/masari/tx2.bin is an upstream transaction used as a parser
regression fixture. Masari is not a supported wallet; see the security notes in
wiki/Security-Model.md and the dated review in
wiki/record-security-review-2026-10-28.md.

